Hi Tim,

The error you received is due to changes in the newest version of  
lme4. We're updating the mixed packages to work with the new version  
presently, and it should be available soon.

For now, ls.mixed and the other mixed routines are tested to work  
with lme4 version 0.99875-9.

Best,
Delia



